{
  "id": "shz01-vo-03",
  "clips": [
    {
      "name": "W01",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "东京八十万禁军教头林冲，为因身犯重罪，断配沧州，",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W01.mp3",
      "bytes": 95755,
      "heard": "東京八十萬禁軍教頭臨沖為因身犯重罪斷配蒼州",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 5.92
    },
    {
      "name": "W02",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "情愿立此休书，任从改嫁。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W02.mp3",
      "bytes": 56049,
      "heard": "情愿立此修书 认从改价",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.44
    },
    {
      "name": "W03",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "这是林冲留给妻子的休书。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W03.mp3",
      "bytes": 44764,
      "heard": "這是臨沖留給妻子的修書",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 2.72
    },
    {
      "name": "W04",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "成亲三年，两人没红过一次脸。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W04.mp3",
      "bytes": 52287,
      "heard": "成亲三年,两人没红过一次脸。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "name": "W05",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "他为什么要休了她？",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W05.mp3",
      "bytes": 26792,
      "heard": "他为什么要修了它",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 1.6
    },
    {
      "name": "W06",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "那时候，他有一身本事，有一个家。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W06.mp3",
      "bytes": 57303,
      "heard": "那時候,它有一生本事,有一個家。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.52
    },
    {
      "name": "W07",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "直到那天在岳庙，有人调戏他的娘子。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W07.mp3",
      "bytes": 61065,
      "heard": "直到那天在月廟有人調戲他的娘子",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.76
    },
    {
      "name": "W08",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "他一把扳过那人，拳头举起来——",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W08.mp3",
      "bytes": 47272,
      "heard": "他一把斑锅内人 拳头举起来",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.88
    },
    {
      "name": "W09",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "却认出，那是上司高太尉的干儿子。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W09.mp3",
      "bytes": 54795,
      "heard": "卻認出那是上司高太尉的乾兒子",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.36
    },
    {
      "name": "W10",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "拳头，软了。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W10.mp3",
      "bytes": 38077,
      "heard": "拳头软了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 2.32
    },
    {
      "name": "W11",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "连最好的朋友陆谦，也站到了他们那边。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W11.mp3",
      "bytes": 56049,
      "heard": "連最好的朋友陸謙也站到了他們那邊",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 3.44
    },
    {
      "name": "W12",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "一把宝刀，把他引进了白虎节堂。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W12.mp3",
      "bytes": 58557,
      "heard": "一把寶刀把他引进了白虎洁堂",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.6
    },
    {
      "name": "W13",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "刺了面，押往沧州。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W13.mp3",
      "bytes": 40585,
      "heard": "刺了面 压往苍州",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.994,
      "seconds": 2.48
    },
    {
      "name": "W14",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "临走前，他请人写了这封休书。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W14.mp3",
      "bytes": 49780,
      "heard": "臨走前,他请人写了这封修书。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 3.04
    },
    {
      "name": "W15",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "他怕自己死在路上，",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W15.mp3",
      "bytes": 31807,
      "heard": "他怕自己死在路上",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 1.92
    },
    {
      "name": "W16",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "更怕高衙内逼她，误了她一辈子。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W16.mp3",
      "bytes": 52287,
      "heard": "更怕高牙內逼他,誤了他一輩子。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.2
    },
    {
      "name": "W17",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "她哭着问：我清清白白，你为什么不要我？",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W17.mp3",
      "bytes": 74021,
      "heard": "她哭着问 我轻轻白白 你为什么不要我",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.994,
      "seconds": 4.56
    },
    {
      "name": "W18",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "他只说：我是好意。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W18.mp3",
      "bytes": 38077,
      "heard": "他只说我是好意。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 2.32
    },
    {
      "name": "W19",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "岳父说：放你回来时，依旧夫妻完聚。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W19.mp3",
      "bytes": 75275,
      "heard": "岳父说,放你回来时依旧夫妻玩具。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 4.64
    },
    {
      "name": "W20",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "为了这句话，他忍着活下去。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W20.mp3",
      "bytes": 51034,
      "heard": "为了这句话他忍着活下去",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.12
    },
    {
      "name": "W21",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "沧州下了大雪，压塌了他的草屋。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W21.mp3",
      "bytes": 58557,
      "heard": "蒼州下了大雪,壓塌了它的草屋。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 3.6
    },
    {
      "name": "W22",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "他躲进山神庙，草料场却烧了起来。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W22.mp3",
      "bytes": 59811,
      "heard": "他躲進山神廟 草廟廠卻燒了起來",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.68
    },
    {
      "name": "W23",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "门外是陆谦的声音：",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W23.mp3",
      "bytes": 34315,
      "heard": "门外是路迁的声音",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.08
    },
    {
      "name": "W24",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "烧死了，拾他一两块骨头回去交差。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W24.mp3",
      "bytes": 58557,
      "heard": "燒死了,使它一兩塊骨頭回去交差",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.6
    },
    {
      "name": "W25",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "回不去了。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W25.mp3",
      "bytes": 21358,
      "heard": "回不去了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.976,
      "seconds": 1.28
    },
    {
      "name": "W26",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "他一把拽开庙门。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W26.mp3",
      "bytes": 29300,
      "heard": "他一把拽開廟門",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.996,
      "seconds": 1.76
    },
    {
      "name": "W27",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "一枪戳倒差拨，再一枪，追倒了逃跑的富安。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W27.mp3",
      "bytes": 70260,
      "heard": "一槍戳倒插波 再一槍追倒了逃跑的富安",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 4.32
    },
    {
      "name": "W28",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "陆谦被他掀翻在雪里，刀，就搁在脸上。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W28.mp3",
      "bytes": 72767,
      "heard": "陸謙被他掀翻在血裡刀就割在臉上",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 4.48
    },
    {
      "name": "W29",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "杀人可恕，情理难容！",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W29.mp3",
      "bytes": 48526,
      "heard": "杀人可恕 情理难容",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.96
    },
    {
      "name": "W30",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "这一回，他没有再忍。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W30.mp3",
      "bytes": 36823,
      "heard": "这一回他没有再忍",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.997,
      "seconds": 2.24
    },
    {
      "name": "W31",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "再后来，他落草梁山。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W31.mp3",
      "bytes": 40585,
      "heard": "再后来它落草良山",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 2.48
    },
    {
      "name": "W32",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "他想接娘子上山，却一拖再拖。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W32.mp3",
      "bytes": 58557,
      "heard": "她想接娘子上山卻亦拖在拖。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.6
    },
    {
      "name": "W33",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "派去的人回来说：娘子被逼自尽，已故半载。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W33.mp3",
      "bytes": 86978,
      "heard": "派去的人回來說,娘子被逼自盡,已故伴宰。",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 5.36
    },
    {
      "name": "W34",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "他哭了。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W34.mp3",
      "bytes": 20105,
      "heard": "他哭了",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.932,
      "seconds": 1.2
    },
    {
      "name": "W35",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "那封休书，没能护住她。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W35.mp3",
      "bytes": 46018,
      "heard": "那封修书没能护住他",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.998,
      "seconds": 2.8
    },
    {
      "name": "W36",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "他立下它，只是想让她好好活着。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W36.mp3",
      "bytes": 56049,
      "heard": "他立下他只是想讓他好好活著",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 1.0,
      "seconds": 3.44
    },
    {
      "name": "W37",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "从此，他心里再没有可挂念的人。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W37.mp3",
      "bytes": 56049,
      "heard": "從此他心裡再沒有可掛念的人",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 3.44
    },
    {
      "name": "W38",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "依旧夫妻完聚——",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W38.mp3",
      "bytes": 34315,
      "heard": "依舊夫妻玩具",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.99,
      "seconds": 2.08
    },
    {
      "name": "W39",
      "lang": "zh",
      "text": "这句话，他终究没能等到。",
      "voice": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "voice_id": "WuLq5z7nEcrhppO0ZQJw",
      "model": "eleven_v4",
      "status": 200,
      "file": "W39.mp3",
      "bytes": 47272,
      "heard": "这句话他终究没能等到",
      "heard_lang": "zh",
      "heard_lang_p": 0.999,
      "seconds": 2.88
    }
  ],
